 "solution": "\\(A(-a,0)\\)，设 \\(P(x_0,y_0)\\)，则 \\(Q(-x_0,y_0)\\)。\\(k_{AP}k_{AQ}=\\dfrac{y_0}{x_0+a}\\cdot\\dfrac{y_0}{-x_0+a}=\\dfrac{y_0^{2}}{a^{2}-x_0^{2}}\\)。\n由 \\(\\dfrac{x_0^{2}}{a^{2}}+\\dfrac{y_0^{2}}{b^{2}}=1\\) 得 \\(y_0^{2}=\\dfrac{b^{2}}{a^{2}}(a^{2}-x_0^{2})\\)，所以 \\(k_{AP}k_{AQ}=\\dfrac{b^{2}}{a^{2}}=\\dfrac14\\)。\n\\(e^{2}=1-\\dfrac{b^{2}}{a^{2}}=\\dfrac34\\)，\\(e=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\)，选 A。",
